        "text": "I had the opportunity to attend another transforming leadership training opportunity here at Juniper Networks I had the opportunity to attend another transforming leadership training opportunity here at Juniper Networks. SBG Leadership Coaching and Consulting. This session focused on “The ABCs of Leadership Success” — a powerful framework that challenged us to reflect, grow, and lead with intention. \nHaving participated in previous trainings with SBG, I continue to be inspired by the depth of insight and perspective they bring to leadership development. Their approach is not just informative — it’s truly impactful.\nI am grateful to be part of a company that prioritizes continuous learning and empowers us to become better leaders every day. 💡\n#LeadershipDevelopment #ContinuousLearning #JuniperNetworks #SBGLeadership #ProfessionalGrowth #LeadershipSuccess",
